    "detailed_description": "<strong>A different kind of Jigsaw!</strong><br><br>The meta for jigsaws has been broken. No longer can you start with the edges and work your way in! You will need a new approach!<br><br><strong>Casual? Challenging? Approachable!</strong><br><br>By limiting the puzzle size to 63 pieces you get an experience that is not overwhelming while still offering a challenging jigsaw to engage your mind. <br><br><strong>Play, Learn &amp; Enjoy!</strong><br><br>Complete puzzles to learn about the subject. For example: Complete a puzzle with elephant and then learn about elephants!<br><br><strong>Earn Achievements!</strong><br><br>Achieve 3 star ratings by completing jigsaws quickly and unlock steam achievements to show everyone your talents!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A different kind of Jigsaw!</strong><br><br>The meta for jigsaws has been broken. No longer can you start with the edges and work your way in! You will need a new approach!<br><br><strong>Casual? Challenging? Approachable!</strong><br><br>By limiting the puzzle size to 63 pieces you get an experience that is not overwhelming while still offering a challenging jigsaw to engage your mind. <br><br><strong>Play, Learn &amp; Enjoy!</strong><br><br>Complete puzzles to learn about the subject. For example: Complete a puzzle with elephant and then learn about elephants!<br><br><strong>Earn Achievements!</strong><br><br>Achieve 3 star ratings by completing jigsaws quickly and unlock steam achievements to show everyone your talents!",
    "short_description": "Start with the edge pieces? No way! Try this challenging, yet approachable, 63 piece jigsaw game that has no edge pieces! 50 jigsaws to complete or choose your own!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
